    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "pg_prewarm 在超大 shared_buffers 上会崩溃",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 的 palloc 对单次分配有 1GB 硬上限，而 autoprewarm 转储缓存页时要一次分配整个数组，每条记录 20 字节，算下来 shared_buffers 超过约 429GB 就会越界。700GB 的机器需要约 1.75GB，于是报出 invalid memory alloc request size，后台进程随即陷入每分钟数百次的重启循环。根治要升到 PostgreSQL 16.10 以上。",
      "url": "https://stormatics.tech/blogs/the-1-gb-limit-that-breaks-pg_prewarm-at-scale",
      "author": "warda bibi",
      "source": "Stormatics",
      "source_date": "2026-04-09",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "pg_prewarm",
        "内存",
        "故障"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "pgcollection 2.0 支持整数键与范围删除",
      "summary": "pgcollection 用关联数组帮 Oracle PL/SQL 代码搬到 PostgreSQL。2.0 新增整数键的 icollection，只存显式设过的键，避开原生数组用 NULL 填补稀疏下标的问题，键是 64 位整数、值可以是任意类型。delete() 现在支持删单键、删区间和清空并保留类型。要注意 Oracle 会自动给字符串键排序，pgcollection 保持插入顺序，需要时得自己调 sort()。",
      "url": "https://mlodgenski.blogspot.com/2026/04/pgcollection-20-integer-keys-range.html",
      "author": "Jim Mlodgenski",
      "source": "Jim Mlodgenski 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-04-09",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "Oracle",
        "扩展",
        "PL/SQL"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "表膨胀会在高频写入下悄悄扩散",
      "summary": "高频写入下，UPDATE 和 DELETE 留下的死元组积累速度会超过 autovacuum 回收的速度，页面碎片化，性能一路下滑。Jake Hertz 指出默认设置要等 20% 的行发生变化才触发清理，对大表意味着可以攒下几百万条死元组。文章给了测量膨胀率的查询，并建议把上亿行的高写入表的 autovacuum_vacuum_scale_factor 降到 0.01 到 0.02，让清理跑得更勤。",
      "url": "https://www.tigerdata.com/blog/preventing-silent-spiral-table-bloat",
      "author": "Jake Hertz",
      "source": "TigerData 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-04-09",
      "image": "https://blog-cms.tigerdata.com/blog/content/images/2026/04/preventing-silents-spiral-table-bloat.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "膨胀",
        "autovacuum"
      ],
      "position": 4
